"""Dashboard generated by the integration.

One sidebar entry ("Medication"; German: "Tabletten") with one view per person. A view is visible
only to the person's Home Assistant user and to administrators. The content
is built on every load from the current medications, so it never needs to be
edited by hand.
"""

